    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念放下杯子，心跳加速。\n收购。他要收购\"念想\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on skin",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她低头看左手。无名指的疤痕——还在。但食指侧面，那个她记得是大学时被纸划伤的小痕迹——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian furrows brow, pressing fingers to temples",
    "spoken_dialogue": "想不起来什么时候划的",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "消失了。\n不是\"想不起来什么时候划的\"——是那道痕迹本身不存在了。食指侧面光滑得像从未受过伤。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的胃缩紧了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the mark has disappeared",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "faint mark",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "她记得昨天也发生了类似的事。昨天那道印痕——就是现在消失的这道。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "连看书都能受伤",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她失去了一段记忆。关于这道伤痕的记忆——大学图书馆，期末复习，不小心被新书的纸页划破，林可笑她\"连看书都能受伤\"——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "这段记忆还在。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你好。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但伤痕本身没了。\n这不对。\n\"你好。\""
  },
  {
